{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations have arrived!\u00a0<i>SpaceCorp: Ventures</i> introduces 14 unique enterprises, each putting a player in control of a different corporation, agency, or institution with its own capabilities and missions. Each HQ assigns specific start cards, Infra, advantages, and limitations for all three eras. These advantages and limitations evolve in Planeteers and Starfarers, and each HQ has a special, alternate final profit option at game end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, at the start of each era, one player selects an eighth contract to be fulfilled, adding an additional way to gain profit and complete the era.<br><br>SpaceCorp: Ventures offers new ways to play SpaceCorp, with new strategies and challenges. Ventures supports both standard mode and the Competition AI!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884720?t=1761946665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884720?t=1761946665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884720/dba1964115f62024bff63e901dfb06aa565f5b2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761946665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884720/dba1964115f62024bff63e901dfb06aa565f5b2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761946665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations have arrived!\u00a0<i>SpaceCorp: Ventures</i> introduces 14 unique enterprises, each putting a player in control of a different corporation, agency, or institution w